    ["I can say the value of each digit in a four- or five-digit number.", "I can read and write numbers up to 10 000 and beyond.", "I can partition a big number in more than one way.", "I can use zero as a place holder in big numbers.", "I can say 1, 10, 100 or 1000 more or less than a number."],
